    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Zmira the friendly witch find her lost magic powers in a world haunted by jumping pumpkins, spitting gargoyles, slimy bats, and many other bewitched creatures. Search for the source of evil and free the kingdom from darkness. Restore life and happiness to the people of this land. Save the creatures of the forest from the Demon's curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover four unique worlds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find different spells to aid you in your journey</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden passages and runes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your broomstick to traverse levels and strategically defeat enemies and obstacles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Cauldron is a cute action-adventure game full of surprises.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Zmira the friendly witch find her lost magic powers in a world haunted by jumping pumpkins, spitting gargoyles, slimy bats, and many other bewitched creatures. Search for the source of evil and free the kingdom from darkness. Restore life and happiness to the people of this land. Save the creatures of the forest from the Demon's curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover four unique worlds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find different spells to aid you in your journey</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden passages and runes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your broomstick to traverse levels and strategically defeat enemies and obstacles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Cauldron is a cute action-adventure game full of surprises.</p>",
    "short_description": "You are Zmira, a brave little witch and your task is not an easy one. Use your spells and travel across worlds to save the Kingdom of Cauldron from the Evil Sorcerer in this unique action platformer.",
